\newlabel{tab:rev_events}{{8}{20}{Interactions before and after a change of organization (stacked event study, W). Poisson PML with stack-by-person and stack-by-year fixed effects; standard errors clustered by person. Treated: linked recipients in a dated U.S. public position in $g-1$ who start a spell in a new organization in $g$, with no other move within three years. Controls: people in office in $g-1$ with no move within three years. ``After'' pools $t \geq g$; ``before'' pools $g-3$ and $g-2$; the reference year is $g-1$}{table.caption.19}{}}
